{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the wilderness of Sinai</b> – Because he interrupted with the commandments of the Sabbatical year and the Jubilee, which were at Mount Sinai, he came back and said here that this utterance was <b>in the Tent of Meeting</b>, like all the commandments that he mentioned from the beginning of the book of Leviticus. And likewise all of them from here onward will be in the Tent of Meeting. For from the time the Tabernacle was established and HaShem called to him from the Tent of Meeting, He did not speak to him except from there. And he mentioned here <b>in the wilderness of Sinai</b> to make known that they had not journeyed from there at the time they were counted, for the second counting was in the plains of Moab, and the utterance was in the Tent of Meeting."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:02:09.272697094Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}